        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Evening dress of pink-rose silk satin trimmed with applied silk satin and blond silk bobbin lace. The skirt is set smoothly at the front but is tightly gathered at the centre of the back and gored to flare at the hem. The dress fastens at the back with hooks and eyes. Puffed sleeves, medium high waist and square neck."@en ;
